## Interface: 20506
## Category: Commander
## Title: Commander Tradecraft
## Author: Devin
## Version: 1.3.0
## Notes: Guided profession leveling, one step on screen at a time: the recipe to craft now, how many more it takes, what you hold against what it needs, and a Craft button (or a Tradecraft macro it keeps for binding) that casts it on your own gear in one click. Formula steps name the vendor and the coordinates, with a Go button for the Commander Orders arrow and a route through the whole trip's vendors; "any trainer" goes to the nearest one and trade-supply reagents to the nearest vendor that sells them; a banner says when a trainer has a new rank for you; the shopping list is the rest of the route by trainer bracket, less what you already own. Enchanting 1 to 375 and First Aid 1 to 375.
## IconTexture: Interface\Icons\Trade_Engraving
## SavedVariables: CommanderTradecraftDB
## SavedVariablesPerCharacter: CommanderTradecraftChar
## RequiredDeps: Commander_Events
## OptionalDeps: Commander_Orders, Auctionator

